  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "superghostConfigs = generateSuperghostConfigsFn[3, 0];\nsuperghostConfigsQMinusOne = generateSuperghostConfigsFn[3, 0, -1];\nrepeatedSuperghostModeQ[modes_List] := Module[{betaNums, gammaNums},\n  betaNums = modeNumbersByHeadName[modes, \"\\[Beta]\"];\n  gammaNums = modeNumbersByHeadName[modes, \"\\[Gamma]\"];\n  Length[betaNums] > Length[DeleteDuplicates[betaNums]] || Length[gammaNums] > Length[DeleteDuplicates[gammaNums]]\n];\nmodesRespectPictureBoundsQ[modes_List, q_] := Module[{betaNums, gammaNums},\n  betaNums = modeNumbersByHeadName[modes, \"\\[Beta]\"];\n  gammaNums = modeNumbersByHeadName[modes, \"\\[Gamma]\"];\n  AllTrue[betaNums, # <= (-3/2 - q) &] && AllTrue[gammaNums, # <= (1/2 + q) &]\n];\ntest6Result = superghostConfigs =!= {} && AnyTrue[superghostConfigs[[All, 1]], repeatedSuperghostModeQ] &&\n  superghostConfigsQMinusOne =!= {} && AllTrue[superghostConfigsQMinusOne[[All, 1]], modesRespectPictureBoundsQ[#, -1] &];\nPrint[\"Test 6 (superghost occupancy + picture-dependent mode bounds): \", If[test6Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest6Result",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<pre>Test 6 (superghost bosonic occupancy): PASSED\n</pre>",
